      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Q1 Result: 0 
Q 2 Result: 0 
Q 3 Result: a team of 6 female lawyers has been recruited to provide legal aid, and legal consultation/ raising awareness to the detainees of women, men, and juveniles.
 in the place of detention, as result, 111 detainees have been released, and 205 received legal consultation. RPA has been signed with Afaq Shababia (ASF)to conduct judicial advocacy and develop a training manual for community conflict resolution and community mediation. as result ASF developed a mediation community committee manual, trained 60 mediators, and provided basic equipment support to six community committees offices at six districts.</narrative>
